<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA barley export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales reductions of 100 MT were all for Canada.</p>
<p>Exports of 2,000 MT--all to Mexico--were down 10 percent from the prior week and 44 percent from the 4-week average.</p>
</text>
